# Normalise line endings so a diff shows the change, not the editor.
#
# Aider's first run (T-002) rewrote every file it touched as CRLF, which made
# an 11-line CSS addition read as a 336-line rewrite and buried the real diff.
# Text files are stored LF in the repo and checked out LF everywhere; this repo
# is developed on Windows, where the whole toolchain (Rust, Node, Vite) is fine
# with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.safetensors binary
